\b\fs26 First steps\b0\fs20\par\par
\li284\fi-284 \u8226?\tab Sign in to Twitch. On the first start Hell Harvest shows a code and opens twitch.tv/activate itself: press "Authorize" in the browser. You never type your password into the app.\par\li0\fi0
\li284\fi-284 \u8226?\tab Choose your games. On the Game Shelf, or with the search on the dashboard, press "Add to queue": the queue runs top to bottom. For drops, your Twitch account usually has to be linked to the game account.\par\li0\fi0
\li284\fi-284 \u8226?\tab Giveaways (optional). Node.js 20 or newer is needed. Open the Giveaways tab, press "Check readiness" and sign in to the stores you want with "Sign in" on their cards.\par\li0\fi0
\li284\fi-284 \u8226?\tab Steam IDLE (optional). Start the Steam client, sign in to the Steam site from the tab and confirm the risk to your account. Tabs you do not need can be turned off in Settings.\par\li0\fi0
\li284\fi-284 \u8226?\tab Tray. Closing the window can send the app to the tray, depending on your choice: farming goes on, and the icon near the clock brings the window back. What the X button does is set in Settings.\par\li0\fi0
\li284\fi-284 \u8226?\tab Help. In the app: the "More" menu, "Help & hotkeys". A full guide is on GitHub: the checkbox below opens it in your browser.\par\li0\fi0
}
